# Claude auth — try the OAuth token first (uses your Claude subscription):
#   run `claude setup-token` on the host and paste the result here.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
# Fallback if setup-token doesn't work (it has failed before): comment the line
# above, uncomment below with an Anthropic API key (metered billing — set spend
# limits in the Anthropic console before long AFK runs).
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# GitHub token for the issue tracker + PR flow (host-side only; sandboxed
# agents never see it). Needs repo scope on
# snowplow-industry-solutions/signals-google-cx-agent-studio. tracker.sh falls
# back to this when GH_TOKEN isn't already in the environment.
GH_TOKEN=
